'''Myrcia''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]] doubles her health and [[Wave Attack]] level. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]].

