==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], Myrcia's True Form's name lacked the "ξ" part in BCEN.
*[[wikipedia:Myrcia|''Myrcia'']] is the name of a genus of tropical American trees and shrubs in the family [[wikipedia:Myrtaceae|Myrtaceae]].
*The ξ in her Evolved/True Form's name is the Greek letter "Xi".
*Myrcia may be a reference to [[wikia:handoreddo:Claire Harvey|Claire Harvey]] from the light novel series ''[[wikipedia:Hundred (novel series)|Hundred]]''.
*Myrcia was the first unit to have the [[Dodge Attack]] ability, which has a chance to gain invulnerability against a specific trait for a set time.

